        "review": "most of the time playing this and completing it ,  i was thinking if i liked this match 3 game.    I've played alot of match 3 and familiar with a wide range of mechanics.  I think this is the first one where automatic matches are mostly ignored.. you have to make a manual match.  So, there is no fun to be had seeing a level just blow up with automatic matches.   The usual visually obstructed mechanic is here but even when you see the object behind the square, sometimes you can't use it in a match ... so all in all it's a bit annoying ...  BUT I did  feel compelled to complete the game and I did have a degree of fun so I'll recommend.   OH Yeah... the automated voices are SOOO BAD and robotic you will just want to skip all the story ... is is truly unbearable.",
